## TTS 스크립트 (영어)

```
Hello, this is a demonstration of our YouTube API usage.

This is our YouTube channel for educational lifestyle content.

We use the YouTube Data API to upload videos.
Here in Postman, you can see the videos.insert endpoint.
We send a POST request with video metadata and the file.

The API returns a successful response with the video ID.

In YouTube Studio, you can see the video is now uploaded.
Our team reviews each video before making it public.

Thank you for reviewing our demonstration.
```

